ropic 扩大合作，成为 Claude Partner Network 全球首要合作伙伴","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T12:22:14.300Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms3esi8000bdrozqs3khucp1","https://www.anthropic.com/news/cognizant-anthropic"],"articles":[{"id":"cms3esi8000bdrozqs3khucp1","title":"Cognizant 与 Anthropic 扩大合作，成为 Claude Partner Network 全球首要合作伙伴","originalTitle":"","summary":"Cognizant 与 Anthropic 扩大合作，成为 Claude Partner Network 中的 Global Premier Partner，并将 Claude 嵌入其 Flowsource 等平台。已有超过 3 万名员工完成 Claude 培训，其为一家生物制药公司构建的智能合约系统将合同审核时间缩短最高 40%，提取准确率超过 88%。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3esi8000bdrozqs3khucp1","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/cognizant-anthropic","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T12:22:14.300Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-15gzes8","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3esi8000bdrozqs3khucp1","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-15gzes8","name":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Cognizant 与 Anthropic 扩大合作，成为 Claude Partner Network 中的 Global Premier Partner，并将 Claude 嵌入其 Flowsource 等平台。已有超过 3 万名员工完成 Claude 培训，其为一家生物制药公司构建的智能合约系统将合同审核时间缩短最高 40%，提取准确率超过 88%。","reportEdition":"2026-07-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3el9cc000orozqcae978wd","title":"Apple 提出 GH-ESD：面向实例级视觉任务的假设驱动错误切片发现方法","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T12:22:14.300Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms3el9cc000orozqcae978wd","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/gh-esd"],"articles":[{"id":"cms3el9cc000orozqcae978wd","title":"Apple 提出 GH-ESD：面向实例级视觉任务的假设驱动错误切片发现方法","originalTitle":"","summary":"Apple 机器学习研究团队提出 GH-ESD（Grounded Hypothesis-Driven Error Slice Discovery），一种针对目标检测与分割等实例级视觉任务的错误切片发现方法。现有方法主要适用于图像级分类，难以捕捉由上下文关系和空间视觉模式导致的实例级失败。GH-ESD 通过基于假设的驱动方式，系统性地发现模型在语义连贯子集上的系统性失效。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3el9cc000orozqcae978wd","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/gh-esd","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T12:22:14.300Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3el9cc000orozqcae978wd","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Apple 机器学习研究团队提出 GH-ESD（Grounded Hypothesis-Driven Error Slice Discovery），一种针对目标检测与分割等实例级视觉任务的错误切片发现方法。现有方法主要适用于图像级分类，难以捕捉由上下文关系和空间视觉模式导致的实例级失败。GH-ESD 通过基于假设的驱动方式，系统性地发现模型在语义连贯子集上的系统性失效。","reportEdition":"2026-07-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3n5wpl001sro82ia