 称越来越多员工用 ChatGPT 做其他岗位的工作","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T12:22:14.300Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","https://the-decoder.com/openai-says-more-workers-are-using-chatgpt-to-do-other-peoples-jobs"],"articles":[{"id":"cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","title":"OpenAI 称越来越多员工用 ChatGPT 做其他岗位的工作","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 分析超 80 万条与工作相关的 ChatGPT 消息后发现，43.5% 的岗位特定查询涉及另一职业，营销和工程任务交叉最多。用户用 AI 处理合同审查、数据分析、网站故障排查等原由专家负责的工作。OpenAI 认为这是岗位职责正在变化的早期信号，该趋势在缺乏专业团队的小公司尤为明显。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-says-more-workers-are-using-chatgpt-to-do-other-peoples-jobs","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T12:22:14.300Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"OpenAI 分析超 80 万条与工作相关的 ChatGPT 消息后发现，43.5% 的岗位特定查询涉及另一职业，营销和工程任务交叉最多。用户用 AI 处理合同审查、数据分析、网站故障排查等原由专家负责的工作。OpenAI 认为这是岗位职责正在变化的早期信号，该趋势在缺乏专业团队的小公司尤为明显。","reportEdition":"2026-07-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms3gqf3h01y1rondsl8z5sxy","title":"GitHub Copilot 